.\n\nFrom the diagram, we see that the length of the segment is $5$ units, so the distance equals $5.$\n\n![](images/8e/8e367b3fe7f6c0f6d7e2fa68569b359bfaac855e588a3a2e3f6e2afb133edde4.png)\n\n**Method 2**\n\nWe can find the distance between the two points by finding the distance of each point from the $y$-axis and then subtracting.\n\n![](images/2c/2cb5654bcbd1d8cf5fc7f612d92d264ae4945c542db4d4a8c90a7e8829adf2d9.png)\n\nThe point $(6,4)$ is at a distance of $6$ from the $y$-axis, and the point $(1,4)$ is at a distance of $1$ from the $y$-axis. Therefore, the distance between the two points is $6-1=5.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-9c53c1e0-930c-5999-9b7f-8f4ad7d1f5eb"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-9c53c1e0-930c-5999-9b7f-8f4ad7d1f5eb" :answer-field/id #uuid "9c53c1e0-930c-5999-9b7f-8f4ad7d1f5eb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-58588886-d522-5a0a-a36e-2e13a21e3f96" :answer-field/choices ["answer-1ec69e0d-f55f-5ad7-b664-bd1ffddfa8ab" "answer-6ee5cb4c-df41-5712-ae39-17291cb92b4d" "answer-a90c5c94-f3a6-570b-8c85-ea07c0c12117" "answer-58588886-d522-5a0a-a36e-2e13a21e3f96" "answer-a969f98e-7e55-516e-a330-a225988cbb54"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1ec69e0d-f55f-5ad7-b664-bd1ffddfa8ab" :answer/id #uuid "1ec69e0d-f55f-5ad7-b664-bd1ffddfa8ab" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6ee5cb4c-df41-5712-ae39-17291cb92b4d" :answer/id #uuid "6ee5cb4c-df41-5712-ae39-17291cb92b4d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a90c5c94-f3a6-570b-8c85-ea07c0c12117" :answer/id #uuid "a90c5c94-f3a6-570b-8c85-ea07c0c12117" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-58588886-d522-5a0a-a36e-2e13a21e3f96" :answer/id #uuid "58588886-d522-5a0a-a36e-2e13a21e3f